of values:\n\n| **$t$** | $1$ | $2$ | $3$ | $4$ | $5$ | $6$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $x$ | $\\frac{1}{2}$ | {{field-1}} | $\\frac{51}{2}$ | $62$ | $\\frac{245}{2}$ | {{field-2}} |\n| $y$ | $0$ | $-3$ | {{field-3}} | $-15$ | $-24$ | $-35$ |" :question/worked-solution "- To find the value of $x(2),$ we substitute $t=2$ into $x={t}^{3}-\\frac{1}{2}t.$ This gives\n\n$$\nx(2)=(2)^{3}-\\frac{1}{2}(2)=8-1=7.\n$$\n\n- To find the value of $y(3),$ we substitute $t=3$ into $y=1-{t}^{2}.$ This gives\n\n$$\ny(3)=1-(3)^{2}=1-9=-8.\n$$\n\n- To find the value of $x(6),$ we substitute $t=6$ into $x={t}^{3}-\\frac{1}{2}t.$ This gives\n\n$$\nx(6)=(6)^{3}-\\frac{1}{2}(6)=216-3=213.\n$$\n\nThen the table is \n\n| **$t$** | $1$ | $2$ | $3$ | $4$ | $5$ | $6$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $x$ | $\\frac{1}{2}$ | $7$ | $\\frac{51}{2}$ | $62$ | $\\frac{245}{2}$ | $213$ |\n| $y$ | $0$ | $-3$ | $-8$ | $-15$ | $-24$ | $-35$ |" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-326248/field-1" "q-326248/field-2" "q-326248/field-3"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "bbf50e27-a8c3-52e7-be21-5d7ed61e5512"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-326248"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-152912/selection/cc54ccae9ecbe61a650173303111652be25e358bea2c6fc89973c699ac869f66" :answer/id #uuid "e2166125-8531-5b25-b602-525074f108f9" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-152912/selection/4ca814a26a9344b418765bf1216091351959544cfa5933e8f718fbb4daf8fcd7" :answer/id #uuid "16bb662b-0b22-57de-b073-c0746413867c" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "II" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-152912/selection/e1b08c30ae6409d86384e6d45f16261c1030a9c86db05f53c8c675e9c30c4980" :answer/id #uuid "c2d3f792-7bce-5b94-984f-aba7e80ca910" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I, II" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-152912/selection/6c